---
// SecureMessenger - Sovereign Build v7.6
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <title>Secure Messenger | Sovereign Ghost Protocol</title>
    <style>
        :root {
            --bg-black: #000000;
            --ghost-dark-green: #004D00;
            --ghost-neon-green: #27AE60;
            --ghost-white: #FFFFFF;
            --ghost-cream: #FFFDD0;
        }

        body {
            background-color: var(--bg-black);
            color: var(--ghost-white);
            font-family: 'Courier New', Courier, monospace;
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            padding: 60px 20px;
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(to bottom, var(--ghost-dark-green), var(--bg-black));
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ghost-neon-green);
        }

        .logo {
            max-width: 140px;
            height: auto;
            margin-bottom: 20px;
            filter: drop-shadow(0 0 15px var(--ghost-neon-green));
        }

        h1 {
            color: var(--ghost-cream);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            letter-spacing: 4px;
            font-size: 2.8em;
            margin: 0;
        }

        .tagline {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            font-weight: bold;
            font-size: 1.2em;
            margin-top: 10px;
        }

        .container {
            max-width: 900px;
            margin: 0 auto;
            padding: 40px 20px;
        }

        section {
            background-color: rgba(0, 77, 0, 0.15);
            margin-bottom: 50px;
            padding: 40px;
            border-radius: 28px;
            border: 1px solid rgba(39, 174, 96, 0.4);
            box-shadow: 0 10px 30px rgba(0,0,0,0.5);
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            text-transform: uppercase;
            border-bottom: 1px solid var(--ghost-dark-green);
            padding-bottom: 15px;
            margin-top: 0;
        }

        .protocol-statement {
            font-size: 1.2em;
            color: var(--ghost-white);
            border-left: 4px solid var(--ghost-neon-green);
            padding-left: 25px;
            font-style: italic;
        }

        .feature-grid {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(250px, 1fr));
            gap: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        .feature-item {
            background: var(--ghost-dark-green);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: 12px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        .support-box {
            text-align: center;
            background: linear-gradient(135deg, var(--ghost-dark-green), #002200);
        }

        .bear-img {
            max-width: 200px;
            border-radius: 50%;
            border: 3px solid var(--ghost-neon-green);
            margin-bottom: 25px;
            background-color: var(--bg-black);
        }

        .highlight {
            color: var(--ghost-neon-green);
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        .donation-text {
            color: var(--ghost-cream);
            font-size: 1.1em;
        }

        footer {
            text-align: center;
            padding: 60px;
            font-size: 0.75em;
            color: #666;
            border-top: 1px solid #222;
        }
    </style>
</head>
<body>

    <header>
        <img src="glass_logo.png" alt="Secure Messenger Logo" class="logo">
        <h1>Secure Messenger</h1>
        <p class="tagline">Physical Sovereignty | Zero-Knowledge Architecture</p>
    </header>

    <div class="container">
        
        <section>
            <h2>To us, you are a Ghost</h2>
            <p class="protocol-statement">
                "We believe your privacy is not a commodity—it is your property. By utilizing the industry-standard Signal Encryption Protocol, we ensure your conversations are mathematically secure from end to end."
            </p>
            <p>
                Our unique <span class="highlight">Ghost Protocol</span> means we do not store any data: we never collect emails, phone numbers, or use cookies, and we have zero interest in harvesting metadata. 
            </p>
            <p>
                Our system acts as a <span class="highlight">Blind Relay</span> using temporary routing codes, ensuring that once a message is delivered, it vanishes from the network forever. Your identity remains your own; your presence remains anonymous.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section class="support-box">
            <img src="bear_panic.png" alt="dQuantumBear" class="bear-img">
            <h2>Built by One, Powered by You</h2>
            <p class="donation-text">
                Secure Messenger is a project developed by <b>one (1) individual</b> with zero (0) support from Big Tech or billionaire funding. 
            </p>
            <p>
                I have zero (0) interest in your data—only one (1) interest in <span class="highlight">Your Privacy</span>. This code is powered by Honey and Honey only. The Jar is thankful and so am I!!!
            </p>
            <p class="highlight">— dQuantumBear</p>
        </section>

        <div class="feature-grid">
            <div class="feature-item">
                <span class="highlight">NO EMAILS</span><br>Anonymous Registration
            </div>
            <div class="feature-item">
                <span class="highlight">NO NUMBERS</span><br>Zero Metadata
            </div>
            <div class="feature-item">
                <span class="highlight">NO COOKIES</span><br>Total Sovereignty
            </div>
        </div>

    </div>

    <footer>
        &copy; 2026 Secure Messenger Project. <br>
        Sovereign Build v8.0.1 | Engineered for Privacy.
    </footer>

</body>
</html>
